Bootstrap: docker
From: python:3.14.4-slim


%post
    apt-get update && apt-get install -y wget libgomp1 build-essential

    # Install BLAST
    wget https://ftp.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/blast/executables/blast+/2.17.0/ncbi-blast-2.17.0+-x64-linux.tar.gz
    tar -xzf ncbi-blast-2.17.0+-x64-linux.tar.gz -C /usr/local/bin/
    ln -s /usr/local/bin/ncbi-blast-2.17.0+/bin/* /usr/local/bin/
    rm -f ncbi-blast-2.17.0+-x64-linux.tar.gz


%runscript
    exec "$@"


%help
    Singularity container of BLAST+ 2.17.0: 
    The NCBI provides a suite of command-line tools to run BLAST called BLAST+
    https://blast.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/doc/blast-help/downloadblastdata.html

    Singularity container of Python 3.14.4: 
    Python is a programming language that lets you work quickly and integrate systems more effectively
    https://www.python.org/


%labels
    Version BLAST+ 2.16.0
    Version Python 3.14.4
    Author Audrey Lapendry
    Date 2026-08-04